        "content": "'''Erika Kirk''' was born Erika Lane Frantzve on 20 November 1988. In 2018 she launched a streetwear line called Proclaim. In September 2025 the Turning Point USA board elected her CEO and chair.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
