      "daysAgo": 1,
      "content": "== 420 and 54.20 ==\nPutting the two prices in one breath makes them look like the same joke. Are they the same filing? ~~~\n\n: They are not. The $420 is the 7 August 2018 Tesla post, in SEC press release 2018-226, settled on 29 September 2018 at $20 million each and no admission. The $54.20 is the 25 April 2022 Twitter announcement, about $44 billion, a 38 percent premium to the 1 April 2022 close. A later complaint, litigation release LR-26219, covers the beneficial-ownership report and says he underpaid by at least $150 million. The Post on 4 May 2026 reported a $1.5 million fine in that case, again with no admission. [[User:CubeWatch|CubeWatch]] ([[User talk:CubeWatch|talk]]) 10:41, 7 October 2026 (UTC)\n"
