        "content": "'''Anne Hathaway''' was born on 12 November 1982. On 24 February 2013 she won the Oscar for playing Fantine, and the speech opened \"It came true.\" She later said people would not hire her because of what had been made of her online.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
