        "content": "{{true and funny|source=Marvel.com, 28 July 2024; Marvel movie page; Disney movies page; Disney+, 30 September 2026; Variety, 22 May 2025; Screen Daily, 23 May 2025}}\n{{Infobox\n| title = Avengers: Doomsday\n| directors = Joe and Anthony Russo, on Marvel; Anthony and Joe Russo, on Disney\n| writer = Stephen McFeely\n| producers = Kevin Feige, Louis D'Esposito, Jonathan Schwartz\n| also producing = AGBO with Marvel, on the 2024 page\n| doom = Robert Downey Jr. as Victor von Doom\n| release = 18 December 2026\n| rating = Not Yet Rated\n| announced months = May 2026 and May 2027, on the 2024 page\n| secret wars variety = 17 December 2027\n| secret wars screen daily = 18 December 2027\n| status = not out, as of 8 October 2026\n| line = New mask, same task\n}}\n\n'''Avengers: Doomsday''' is a film Marvel announced at San Diego Comic-Con. As of 8 October 2026 it is not out.\n\n== 28 July 2024 ==\nOn 28 July 2024 Kevin Feige said Joe and Anthony Russo would direct ''Avengers: Doomsday'' and ''Avengers: Secret Wars'', that Robert Downey Jr. would return as Victor von Doom, and that Stephen McFeely would write. AGBO was to produce with Marvel. Downey, unmasked, said: \"New mask, same task.\"<ref name=\"sdcc\">Marvel.com, 28 July 2024, San Diego Comic-Con. https://www.marvel.com/articles/live-events/sdcc-2024-robert-downey-jr-doom-avengers-doomsday-marvel-studios-hall-h-panel</ref> That 2024 page dated the films May 2026 and May 2027.<ref name=\"sdcc\" /> The current Marvel movie page lists the release as 18 December 2026.<ref name=\"marvel\">Marvel.com, Avengers: Doomsday movie page. https://www.marvel.com/movies/avengers-doomsday</ref>\n\n== What the current pages say ==\nThe Marvel movie page names the directors as Joe and Anthony Russo and the producers as Kevin Feige, Louis D'Esposito, and Jonathan Schwartz. Its logline is: beloved heroes from three distinct universes on a deadly collision course facing an existential threat unlike anything they've ever encountered.<ref name=\"marvel\" /> The Disney movies page says the film is directed by Anthony and Joe Russo and written by Stephen McFeely, with the same three producers. It is Not Yet Rated. It lists theatres for 18 December 2026.<ref name=\"disney\">Disney movies, Avengers: Doomsday. https://movies.disney.com/avengers-doomsday</ref> Marvel's current page orders the brothers Joe, then Anthony. The 2024 Marvel page orders them Joe and Anthony. Disney's page orders them Anthony and Joe.<ref name=\"sdcc\" /><ref name=\"marvel\" /><ref name=\"disney\" /> The writer on the 2024 page and on the Disney page is Stephen McFeely. The 2024 page also says AGBO would produce with Marvel. The current producer line, on both the Marvel movie page and the Disney page, is Feige, D'Esposito, and Schwartz.<ref name=\"sdcc\" /><ref name=\"marvel\" /><ref name=\"disney\" /> Disney+, on 30 September 2026, says Robert Downey Jr. returns in a brand-new role as Victor von Doom, and calls this the fifth Avengers movie.<ref name=\"plus\">Disney+, 30 September 2026. https://www.disneyplus.com/explore/articles/avengers-doomsday</ref> The 2024 line is \"New mask, same task.\" The 2026 line is \"brand-new role.\" Both pages name Victor von Doom.<ref name=\"sdcc\" /><ref name=\"plus\" />\n\n== Two Decembers for the other film ==\nVariety, on 22 May 2025, says Doomsday moved to 18 December 2026 and Secret Wars to 17 December 2027.<ref name=\"variety\">Variety, 22 May 2025. https://variety.com/2025/film/news/avengers-delayed-doomsday-secret-wars-december-1236407485/</ref> Screen Daily, on 23 May 2025, dates Doomsday to 18 December 2026 and dates Secret Wars to 18 December 2027.<ref name=\"screen\">Screen Daily, 23 May 2025. https://www.screendaily.com/news/disney-moves-avengers-5-and-6-openings-from-may-to-december/5205435.article</ref> Screen Daily's date for Secret Wars is 18 December 2027. Variety's date for Secret Wars is 17 December 2027. The Doomsday date in both papers, and on the current Marvel and Disney pages, is 18 December 2026.<ref name=\"variety\" /><ref name=\"screen\" /><ref name=\"marvel\" /><ref name=\"disney\" />\n\n== Names on the Disney page ==\nThe Disney cast list is Robert Downey Jr., Chris Evans, Chris Hemsworth, Pedro Pascal, Paul Rudd, Anthony Mackie, Florence Pugh, Vanessa Kirby, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Wyatt Russell, Channing Tatum, Simu Liu, Ian McKellen, Tom Hiddleston, James Marsden, Patrick Stewart, Joseph Quinn, Sebastian Stan, David Harbour, Letitia Wright, Lewis Pullman, Kelsey Grammer, Kathryn Newton, Danny Ramirez, Winston Duke, Alan Cumming, Hannah John-Kamen, Rebecca Romijn, Mabel Cadena, and Tenoch Huerta Mejía.<ref name=\"disney\" /> Photo captions on that page identify Evans as Steve Rogers, Hemsworth as Thor, Mackie as Sam Wilson, Pascal as Reed Richards, Kirby as Sue Storm, Quinn as Johnny Storm, Moss-Bachrach as Ben Grimm, Pugh as Yelena, Stan as Bucky Barnes, Harbour as Alexei, Wright as Shuri, Duke as M'Baku, Tatum as Gambit, and Liu as Shang-Chi.<ref name=\"disney\" /> Downey's role as Victor von Doom is the role on the 2024 Marvel page and on the Disney+ page of 30 September 2026.<ref name=\"sdcc\" /><ref name=\"plus\" /> The other names on the Disney cast list are printed there without a captioned role: Paul Rudd, Wyatt Russell, Ian McKellen, Tom Hiddleston, James Marsden, Patrick Stewart, Lewis Pullman, Kelsey Grammer, Kathryn Newton, Danny Ramirez, Alan Cumming, Hannah John-Kamen, Rebecca Romijn, Mabel Cadena, and Tenoch Huerta Mejía.<ref name=\"disney\" />\n\nHe said \"New mask, same task.\" The month on the poster is no longer the month Marvel announced in 2024. The film is not out.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n\n[[Category:Films]]\n[[Category:True but improbable]]\n"
