        "content": "'''Taylor Swift''' re-recorded four albums and then bought the masters of the first six. The debut was already re-recorded and unreleased. Reputation was not a quarter done. Ticketmaster logged 3.5 billion system requests.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
