        "content": "'''Virginia Giuffre''' died on 25 April 2025, aged 41. Her family said she died by suicide. Police said a 41-year-old woman was found unresponsive in Neergabby and that the death was not suspicious. The court letter said the settlement sum was not being disclosed. The book was called Nobody's Girl.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
