        "content": "'''John F. Kennedy''' gave the inaugural address on 20 January 1961, including the ask-not sentence. A 2003 paper says there is no valid evidence that images played any role in the televised debate. The radio story does not survive the paper. The inaugural sentence does.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
